WEBVTT

00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:00.553
And it's collected
by my general practitioner as well,

00:01:00.577 --> 00:01:03.976
so he can see what's my problem in weight,

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.677
not on the very moment
that I need cardiologic support

00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:08.892
or something like it,

00:01:08.916 --> 00:01:10.976
but also looking backward.

00:01:11.574 --> 00:01:12.934
But there's another thing.

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:14.437
As some of you might know,

00:01:14.461 --> 00:01:16.787
I've got more than 4000
followers on Twitter.

00:01:16.811 --> 00:01:20.429
So every morning, I hop on my weight scale

00:01:20.453 --> 00:01:21.717
and before I'm in my car,

00:01:21.741 --> 00:01:23.050
people start talking to me,

00:01:23.074 --> 00:01:25.372
"I think you need
a light lunch today, Lucien."

00:01:25.396 --> 00:01:26.547
(Laughter)

00:01:26.571 --> 00:01:28.714
But that's the nicest thing
that could happen,

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:30.293
since this is peer pressure.